@host = http://localhost:5085

### 1. Successful login (200, normal event)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Failed login (401, security event). Send it 5 times to simulate an attack.
# The 5th failure is escalated to a Critical incident and the IP is locked out.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 3. Login while locked out (429 with a Retry-After header)
# Even the correct password is refused until the lockout expires.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}
